# Vault Backup Cron & Heartbeat Monitoring

## Required cron entry
/etc/cron.d/sovereign-vault-backup runs daily at 03:00 UTC:
  /opt/clinical-sovereignty-lab/scripts/daily_vault_backup.sh

## Required heartbeat
Script writes /opt/clinical-sovereignty-lab/backups/vaults/.last_backup_heartbeat with ISO timestamp on each successful run.

## Required monitoring
Trust enforcer or scheduled audit check: if heartbeat file mtime is older than 48 hours, raise alert.

## Required retention
30 days of vault_backup_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS.tar.gz rotated; older files auto-deleted by script.

## Why
2026-04-14 to 2026-05-12: vault backup cron stopped silently. No heartbeat monitoring meant 28 days passed without detection. When 2026-05-12 wipe occurred, restore floor was 2026-04-14, losing 28 days of unrecoverable client metrics.
